<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Assignment 3 - Block and Inline</title>
<style>
/* Block elements: take the full width and start on a new line */
div  { background: lightblue; margin: 5px; padding: 2px 4px; }
/* Inline elements: take only the width they need and sit side by side */
span { background: lightgreen; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div>Block 1</div>
<div>Block 2</div>
<span>Inline 1</span>
<span>Inline 2</span>
<span>Inline 3</span>
</body>
</html>
